(Will you sponsor me?)

81
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:32,394
With the help of God, we will.

82
00:04:32,394 --> 00:04:32,394
(Will you sponsor me?)

83
00:04:32,394 --> 00:04:36,303
We will. We will.

84
00:04:36,303 --> 00:04:36,303
(Will you sponsor me?)

85
00:04:36,303 --> 00:04:44,441
With the help of God, we will.

86
00:04:44,441 --> 00:04:44,441
(Will you sponsor me?)

87
00:04:44,441 --> 00:04:51,782
We will. We will.

88
00:04:51,782 --> 00:04:51,782
[Outro - the band falls away, metronome kick, one guitar]

89
00:04:51,782 --> 00:04:56,968
Five in the morning, and the cockerel crows.

90
00:04:56,968 --> 00:05:01,037
She's on the road with a reading book.

91
00:05:01,037 --> 00:05:06,463
The yellow can is full beside the door,

92
00:05:06,463 --> 00:05:12,606
And she's running.

93
00:05:12,606 --> 00:05:12,606
[Spoken - male, almost a whisper]

94
00:05:12,606 --> 00:05:12,846
I will.

95
